---
---

<section class="about" id="nosotros">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-images">
        <div class="img-main">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?w=800&q=80"
            alt="Playa Aguadulce Rota desde el camping"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="img-secondary">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1478131143081-80f7f84ca84d?w=500&q=80"
            alt="Parcelas del camping con sombra"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="img-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 17c0-3.5 4-6 9-6s9 2.5 9 6"/><line x1="12" y1="11" x2="9" y2="22"/><circle cx="17" cy="5" r="2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="badge-text">
            <strong>Acceso directo</strong>
            <span>a la playa</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content">
        <p class="about-tag">El Camping</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Un lugar especial<br />en la Costa de la Luz</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p class="about-desc">
          Camping Playa Aguadulce es un camping familiar situado entre Rota y Chipiona (Cádiz),
          con acceso directo a una de las playas más extensas y menos masificadas de la Costa de la Luz.
          Arena fina kilométrica, aguas limpias y tranquilidad absoluta.
        </p>
        <p class="about-desc">
          Llevamos décadas acogiendo a familias, parejas y viajeros que buscan desconectar. Nuestras
          parcelas amplias con sombra natural y toldos, junto con un servicio de limpieza impecable,
          han convertido este lugar en el favorito de miles de campistas que repiten año tras año.
        </p>

        <div class="about-highlights">
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="h-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 6c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1C7 7 7 5 9.5 5s2.4 2 5 2 2.5-2 5-2c1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"/><path d="M2 12c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2s2.4 2 5 2 2.5-2 5-2c1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"/><path d="M2 18c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2s2.4 2 5 2 2.5-2 5-2c1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"/></svg></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Playa semi-virgen</strong>
              <p>Kilómetros de arena fina a 2 minutos a pie</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="h-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Ambiente familiar</strong>
              <p>Tranquilo, seguro y con actividades para niños</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="h-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/></svg></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Limpieza excepcional</strong>
              <p>Baños y duchas limpios durante todo el día</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-item">
            <div class="h-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 14c.83-1.37 1-3 1-4a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 1 .17 2.63 1 4"/><line x1="12" y1="10" x2="12" y2="21"/><line x1="9" y1="18" x2="15" y2="18"/></svg></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Parcelas con sombra</strong>
              <p>Vegetación natural y toldos en todas las parcelas</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-actions">
          <a href="#alojamiento" class="btn btn-primary">Ver alojamientos</a>
          <a href="#contacto" class="btn-link">
            Hacer una reserva →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-images {
    position: relative;
  }

  .img-main {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
  }

  .img-main img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  .img-main:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .img-secondary {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -2rem;
    right: -2rem;
    width: 55%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    border: 4px solid var(--color-white);
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
  }

  .img-secondary img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .img-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    left: -1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .badge-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .badge-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .badge-text strong {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .badge-text span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .about-tag {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--color-secondary);
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.75rem;
  }

  .about-desc {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .about-highlights {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .highlight-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .h-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .highlight-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .highlight-item p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .btn-link {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: gap 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .about-images {
      padding-bottom: 3rem;
      padding-right: 2rem;
    }

    .img-badge {
      left: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .about-highlights {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .img-secondary {
      right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
